# Security Policy for [[.Name]]

## Supported versions

Security fixes target the latest released tag and the default branch.

## Reporting a vulnerability

Report privately to the repository maintainers (GitHub Security Advisories
preferred). Do not open public issues for unfixed vulnerabilities.

## Dependency review

Pull requests are subject to GitHub Dependency Review (see
`.github/workflows/dependency-review.yml`). Runtime dependencies are minimized;
release tooling versions are pinned in documentation and workflows.
